Visit Las Pegasus

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_VISIT_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
That day, as Maud Pie was playing with her pet Rock as usual, a sudden thought struck her.\nIf the rock farm ever came to a final confrontation with the Empire, would the Flim Flam brothers try to meddle in it?\nThe long border would inevitably divide much of their military’s attention — and this question, Maud Pie had to find a clear answer to.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_VISIT_LAS_PEGASUS]
出访洛马基

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_VISIT_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
当今天石灰派照例与她的宠物卵石玩耍的时候，她突然想起了一件事，如果采石农场真与帝国到了一决胜负的时候，弗莱姆兄弟是否会从中作梗？漫长的边界线将不得不分散军队的许多注意力，这个问题，石灰派必须得去问个明白
